      "text": "My Grok Bot is connected to my finance, email inbox, coding, etc. I asked Grok Bot from my Cybertruck while I was on roadtrip (w/FSD) to update me on emails and the status on app I am building. It literally pulled out everything I needed effortlessly, just with voice.",
