      "text": "This is just so strange.  I'm talking to grokbot on my ipad, while it manipulates files on my mac, trying to adjust a voice/video sync problem induced by my use of a bluetooth microphone.  The two of \"us\" are debugging the idiosyncrasies of Camtasia to get it to work.  \n\nI mean, It's like talking to a very capable and thoughtful assistant.\n\nWierd.",
