      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "This weekend I introduced Grok @bot to some family and friends. They were fascinated at what I was doing with it. Some have now downloaded it and are trying it out to help them with their businesses. You can still see the fear of using such a product but also the willingness to take the first step snd explore. \n\nIts crazy that no one had heard of it or dots or similar. But slowly these products will make it to more and more people especially outside the tech world.",
