      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Give Grok @Bot your hardest tasks",
      "quote": {
        "author": "ScottyBeamIO",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2029514153656721409/27fG1cCf_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-12 23:00:29",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-12T15:00:29.000Z",
        "id": "2109660484144169136",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2109660332348088320/img/SHLaWUamai-806Iq.jpg"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "duration": 30,
            "height": 1350,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2109660332348088320/img/SHLaWUamai-806Iq.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2109660332348088320/vid/avc1/1080x1350/D53K-fucmAO2urZf.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1080
          }
        ],
        "name": "SCOTTY BEAM",
        "text": "THAT'S F*CKING INSANE, GROK BOT JUST PLANNED MY TRIP TO LISBON AND BOOKED IT WITH MY CARD.\n\nI ONLY HAD TO ASK. IT HANDLED THE RESEARCH AND THE BOOKINGS.\n\nElon Musk recently used Grok Bot to buy LEGO for his kids. That made me want to test something bigger: whether it could fully plan, research, and book my trip to Lisbon on its own.\n\nGrok Bot searched for travel options, compared prices, and booked what I needed using my card and the details I provided.\n\nHere’s what it handled:\n\n→ Researched options for my Lisbon trip.\n→ Compared prices and picked the best-priced options it found for my request.\n→ Completed the bookings using my travel and payment details.\n\nMy trip was booked.\n\nThink about how much time usually goes into this: searching, comparing options, checking availability, and filling out booking forms.\n\nThis time, I gave that job to Grok Bot.\n\nThat’s what makes this interesting to me. A task that normally takes my time and attention ended with real bookings after I asked an agent to handle it.\n\nNow I want to see what else I can take off my to-do list.\n\nI covered the latest major Grok Bot updates and more ways to use them in my article below.\n\nBookmark this and read the full breakdown ↓",
        "url": "https://x.com/ScottyBeamIO/status/2109660484144169136",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
